-- 006: convert varchar FK/reference columns to uuid across the live schema.
-- RLS policies reference tenantId columns, so this transaction:
--   1. drops all policies on public tables (captured below verbatim)
--   2. runs the ALTER COLUMN ... TYPE uuid statements (same 315 columns as the entity codemod)
--   3. re-creates the policies exactly as captured
